Oh, they have a brewing station in there.

2244
02:09:41,900 --> 02:09:42,880
What am I hearing?

2245
02:09:43,360 --> 02:09:45,460
I thought I walked on a pressure plate.

2246
02:09:47,180 --> 02:09:48,740
Are you guys clicking on something?

2247
02:09:50,020 --> 02:09:51,700
Guys, what the fuck is going on over there?

2248
02:09:51,800 --> 02:09:52,260
Get out of the bed.

2249
02:09:53,260 --> 02:09:54,020
I'm sleeping.

2250
02:09:55,340 --> 02:09:56,700
Yeah, they're clicking on a button.

2251
02:09:57,580 --> 02:09:59,700
It sounded like I stepped on a pressure plate.

2252
02:10:01,800 --> 02:10:02,860
That was so confusing.

2253
02:10:04,840 --> 02:10:06,420
Okay, if I die, I end up here now.

2254
02:10:07,240 --> 02:10:08,580
But I'm not gonna die, of course.

2255
02:10:09,220 --> 02:10:10,120
Haha, I mean...

2256
02:10:10,120 --> 02:10:11,280
No way, Jose.

2257
02:10:12,660 --> 02:10:13,740
Just saying that, you know.

2258
02:10:14,300 --> 02:10:15,040
So it's said.

2259
02:10:16,180 --> 02:10:19,060
So that nobody can come in here and say, you didn't say that, but now I did.

2260
02:10:19,580 --> 02:10:20,320
I did say that.

2261
02:10:21,360 --> 02:10:22,280
Look at all these trees.

2262
02:10:22,400 --> 02:10:24,860
That's exactly what a man needs, under these circumstances.

2263
02:10:33,600 --> 02:10:35,280
Good old oak, as well.

2264
02:10:35,980 --> 02:10:36,900
It's my favorite.

2265
02:10:41,520 --> 02:10:43,900
And we're gonna be mixing and matching wood as well.

2266
02:10:44,100 --> 02:10:45,180
Like I did that one time.

2267
02:10:47,600 --> 02:10:50,820
We're going to have support beams and shit.

2268
02:10:51,780 --> 02:10:52,720
It's gonna be lovely.

2269
02:10:53,940 --> 02:10:54,900
Custom porch.

2270
02:10:56,100 --> 02:10:57,340
Something like that, at least.

2271
02:10:57,660 --> 02:11:00,600
I'm imagining something in my mind right now, but...

2272
02:11:01,460 --> 02:11:04,900
Let's see how well I can execute on that imagination.

2273
02:11:07,280 --> 02:11:13,140
But there's going to be a million different iterations, most likely.

2274
02:11:13,300 --> 02:11:17,200
So be prepared for me to just tear down shit right after I've made it and change my mind.

2275
02:11:18,600 --> 02:11:19,720
Because that's how I operate.

2276
02:11:24,140 --> 02:11:24,540
Okay.

2277
02:11:24,680 --> 02:11:26,380
I need some ascension blocks here.

2278
02:11:27,560 --> 02:11:28,400
Just a couple.

2279
02:11:30,000 --> 02:11:30,880
No more than that.

2280
02:11:30,900 --> 02:11:31,460
I think that's good.

2281
02:11:47,170 --> 02:11:48,150
I hate these trees.

2282
02:11:48,250 --> 02:11:49,190
Why did I do this one?

2283
02:11:53,560 --> 02:11:54,580
I always regret it.

2284
02:11:54,680 --> 02:11:56,420
I look at it and go, ah, it's probably not gonna be too bad.

2285
02:11:56,540 --> 02:11:58,040
But it is that bad.

2286
02:12:00,200 --> 02:12:00,760
Did I do it?

2287
02:12:03,000 --> 02:12:03,560
I did it.

2288
02:12:03,940 --> 02:12:06,020
As soon as you can see these things start to dis...

2289
02:12:06,020 --> 02:12:06,960
No, wait, wait, I didn't.

2290
02:12:10,860 --> 02:12:12,320
Wait, why were things disappearing then?

2291
02:12:13,380 --> 02:12:25,400
According to my understanding of how this works is that whenever every part of the center, the rod of the tree, whenever that's gone, then these things start to disappear.

2292
02:12:25,940 --> 02:12:26,740
Like right now.

2293
02:12:26,980 --> 02:12:27,760
You see these old trees?

2294
02:12:29,560 --> 02:12:32,080
So that's how you know that you've done the whole tree.

2295
02:12:36,460 --> 02:12:38,820
And I'm gonna make so much- I'm gonna get so much wood here.

2296
02:12:39,200 --> 02:12:40,940
You're gonna think I'm gonna get a lot of wood?

2297
02:12:41,220 --> 02:12:42,300
But it's gonna be more than that.

2298
02:12:43,100 --> 02:12:45,060
You can't even imagine how much wood I'm gonna get.

2299
02:12:47,640 --> 02:12:48,960
Oh no, did I just start a bad tree?

2300
02:12:51,520 --> 02:12:52,080
I didn't.

2301
02:12:52,260 --> 02:12:52,700
Okay, we're good.

2302
02:12:55,120 --> 02:12:56,600
I thought I made a grave mistake.

2303
02:12:57,240 --> 02:12:57,720
Everything's fine.

2304
02:12:58,680 --> 02:13:01,860
Also, I am gonna replant these trees just to not mess with the ecosystem.

2305
02:13:07,790 --> 02:13:08,710
I'm not like that.

2306
02:13:08,910 --> 02:13:10,930
I don't just go around take, you know.

2307
02:13:11,050 --> 02:13:12,150
I give back as well.

2308
02:13:16,320 --> 02:13:17,000
Oh no!

2309
02:13:19,020 --> 02:13:19,820
You know what?

2310
02:13:20,520 --> 02:13:20,920
No.

2311
02:13:21,720 --> 02:13:22,120
Nope.

2312
02:13:23,620 --> 02:13:24,860
I'm sorry tree, I'm sorry.

2313
02:13:25,000 --> 02:13:25,680
This never happened.

2314
02:13:26,340 --> 02:13:27,180
Go back to existing.

2315
02:13:33,700 --> 02:13:34,340
This one.

2316
02:13:36,340 --> 02:13:37,340
No, I did it again.

2317
02:13:43,560 --> 02:13:44,940
Is that a normal tree?

2318
02:13:45,060 --> 02:13:45,700
It is a normal tree.

2319
02:13:46,560 --> 02:13:48,300
And when I say normal, I mean simple.

2320
02:13:50,220 --> 02:13:52,120
Why aren't all trees that simple?

2321
02:13:58,650 --> 02:13:59,170
Nice.

2322
02:14:03,070 --> 02:14:09,730
So I'm thinking we mix oak with whatever other tree sort we have nearby that's different.

2323
02:14:10,710 --> 02:14:13,150
I do have some spruce in my backpack, but...

2324
02:14:14,390 --> 02:14:15,830
it's only like a single stack.

2325
02:14:15,990 --> 02:14:16,630
That's not gonna be enough.

2326
02:14:17,450 --> 02:14:18,970
So, we're gonna find something else.

2327
02:14:19,590 --> 02:14:20,650
Maybe it's gonna be birch.

2328
02:14:20,770 --> 02:14:21,470
Yeah, look, birch!

2329
02:14:21,630 --> 02:14:22,250
We got birch.

2330
02:14:23,610 --> 02:14:24,910
It's birching time, baby!

2331
02:14:26,010 --> 02:14:28,470
We're gonna mix birch and oak and see how that turns out.

2332
02:14:28,650 --> 02:14:30,830
I think I've tried that before, but we're gonna do it even better now.

2333
02:14:35,590 --> 02:14:37,870
Honestly guys, I almost wanna build that...

2334
02:14:37,870 --> 02:14:43,290
the same hut that I had at my third location in the original Minecraft series.

2335
02:14:45,130 --> 02:14:48,310
The one that I blatantly stole from the villagers.

2336
02:14:48,710 --> 02:14:49,330
The design.

2337
02:14:50,310 --> 02:14:52,090
I want that same design again.

2338
02:14:52,450 --> 02:14:53,950
I love that one so much.

2339
02:14:54,930 --> 02:14:55,370
It's...

2340
02:14:55,370 --> 02:14:56,210
I love simplicity.

2341
02:14:56,450 --> 02:14:57,170
What can I say?

2342
02:14:57,950 --> 02:14:59,930
And then I wanna expand on that idea.

2343
02:15:00,130 --> 02:15:02,830
I wanna use it as a basis and then, you know, take it from there.

2344
02:15:07,200 --> 02:15:08,740
I'm glad I brought another axe.

2345
02:15:18,900 --> 02:15:19,340
Okay.

2346
02:15:19,840 --> 02:15:20,680
Nope, nope.

2347
02:15:21,000 --> 02:15:21,900
I'm not gonna do that.

2348
02:15:22,700 --> 02:15:23,760
Not gonna do it.

2349
02:15:24,500 --> 02:15:24,940
Noooo.

2350
02:15:25,360 --> 02:15:26,360
I'm gonna leave him living.

2351
02:15:29,220 --> 02:15:30,060
That one now.

2352
02:15:34,730 --> 02:15:35,210
Apple!

2353
02:15:36,190 --> 02:15:38,330
These fucking things are so rare.

2354
02:15:40,630 --> 02:15:41,610
By the way!

2355
02:15:42,970 --> 02:15:44,690
There's an achievement that I never got.

2356
02:15:45,390 --> 02:15:46,410
Related to apples.

2357
02:15:51,300 --> 02:15:51,780
Somewhere.

2358
02:15:54,920 --> 02:15:58,300
I guess I'll fu- Wait, what?

2359
02:16:00,760 --> 02:16:01,840
It wasn't that one.

2360
02:16:01,980 --> 02:16:02,720
It was something else.

2361
02:16:03,160 --> 02:16:05,120
I guess I'll see it at some point.

2362
02:16:05,720 --> 02:16:07,720
But, of course, we gotta do all the achievements.

2363
02:16:10,560 --> 02:16:12,360
So, naturally, we gotta do that one as well.

2364
02:16:15,840 --> 02:16:16,560
It reminds me.

2365
02:16:16,580 --> 02:16:17,940
I should start eating everything I see.

2366
02:16:19,200 --> 02:16:20,000
Eat the apple.

2367
02:16:20,900 --> 02:16:21,660
I can't!

2368
02:16:21,740 --> 02:16:22,220
Oh, I'm full.

2369
02:16:22,340 --> 02:16:22,580
I see.

2370
02:16:23,840 --> 02:16:24,220
Noooo!

2371
02:16:24,260 --> 02:16:24,620
Put it back.

2372
02:16:26,720 --> 02:16:27,340
Birch time?

2373
02:16:28,140 --> 02:16:30,260
There's actually not that much birch here.

2374
02:16:31,060 --> 02:16:31,920
It's kinda scarce.

2375
02:16:35,700 --> 02:16:38,220
I am totally making, uh, birch go extinct.

2376
02:16:40,920 --> 02:16:41,860
In this region.

2377
02:16:43,160 --> 02:16:43,960
You know what?

2378
02:16:43,960 --> 02:16:45,420
We even have wood over there!

2379
02:16:46,160 --> 02:16:47,260
A different kind!

2380
02:16:47,420 --> 02:16:47,980
We can put- Ooh!

2381
02:16:48,220 --> 02:16:50,060
Do we make a triple color house?!

2382
02:16:52,000 --> 02:16:52,480
TCH?!

2383
02:16:55,080 --> 02:16:56,640
I think I'm gonna do it, guys!

2384
02:16:57,860 --> 02:16:59,300
We're breaking new ground here.

2385
02:17:00,160 --> 02:17:03,420
We have ample supply of wood on the other side of that bank.

2386
02:17:04,380 --> 02:17:06,080
We're on the bank there, on the other side.

2387
02:17:06,240 --> 02:17:07,320
I can't even speak.

2388
02:17:08,340 --> 02:17:10,020
We're gonna try something crazy.

2389
02:17:13,820 --> 02:17:14,140
Oh!

2390
02:17:14,440 --> 02:17:15,260
I thought it was Stuart!

2391
02:17:18,820 --> 02:17:19,500
How you doing?

2392
02:17:25,660 --> 02:17:26,220
Thank you.

2393
02:17:29,200 --> 02:17:29,520
Right.

2394
02:17:32,720 --> 02:17:33,500
What does this do again?

2395
02:17:35,660 --> 02:17:36,720
Bad Omen 3, right.

2396
02:17:37,920 --> 02:17:40,080
Wait a minute, didn't I have a Bad Omen 2 last time or something?

2397
02:17:40,140 --> 02:17:41,160
There's different variations of it.

2398
02:17:41,340 --> 02:17:41,660
Noooo!

2399
02:17:41,740 --> 02:17:42,980
I'm doing the wrong tree again!

2400
02:17:45,460 --> 02:17:45,780
Noooo!

2401
02:17:49,240 --> 02:17:50,360
Wait, there's more, there's more, there's more!

2402
02:17:58,920 --> 02:17:59,320
Ahh!

2403
02:18:01,820 --> 02:18:02,620
You dumbass.

2404
02:18:10,450 --> 02:18:11,110
Aw, dude!

2405
02:18:11,310 --> 02:18:12,470
I kinda regret drinking that!

2406
02:18:13,130 --> 02:18:16,850
We could probably, uh, experiment with that at the brewing station, now that we have one there.

2407
02:18:17,630 --> 02:18:19,790
Imagine putting that in and extending it or something.

2408
02:18:22,050 --> 02:18:25,190
I mean, I don't know why I would extend it, but...

2409
02:18:25,190 --> 02:18:27,650
You know, maybe there's something to be done with it.

2410
02:18:27,830 --> 02:18:29,990
Because there are potions I haven't discovered yet.

2411
02:18:30,610 --> 02:18:38,350
And I'm starting to think maybe those potions can only be made by having a pre-existing potion like that one we just got.

2412
02:18:38,990 --> 02:18:41,750
You know, you find it in the world and then you modify it from there.

2413
02:18:44,980 --> 02:18:47,380
Because I literally tried everything last time.

2414
02:18:47,560 --> 02:18:51,400
I mean, all the items that I ever found in the game I tried in the brewing stand.

2415
02:18:52,620 --> 02:18:57,420
And I discovered, like, a lot, but not everything.

2416
02:19:02,920 --> 02:19:04,880
Also, I'm getting an absurd amount of wood here.

2417
02:19:06,240 --> 02:19:07,760
It's not that absurd, yet.

2418
02:19:08,040 --> 02:19:08,480
We need more.

2419
02:19:10,000 --> 02:19:13,440
I'm not stopping until this axe is completely gone.

2420
02:19:15,340 --> 02:19:16,820
That's how much wood I'm gathering.

2421
02:19:19,080 --> 02:19:20,080
That's a nice tree.

2422
02:19:25,160 --> 02:19:27,320
I will not be distracted by anything right now.

2423
02:19:27,460 --> 02:19:29,360
It's only wood chopping.

2424
02:19:41,480 --> 02:19:41,860
Good.

2425
02:19:43,160 --> 02:19:44,620
The bee over there...

2426
02:19:45,420 --> 02:19:48,240
There was a way to transport that thing and I forgot how I did it.

2427
02:19:49,740 --> 02:19:52,400
But the achievement tells me how to do it.

2428
02:19:56,420 --> 02:19:56,900
Whoops.

2429
02:19:56,900 --> 02:19:58,740
Don't use the pickaxe, you dummy.

2430
02:20:00,020 --> 02:20:00,740
Cheers, everybody.

2431
02:20:10,460 --> 02:20:14,900
Is there anything better in life than just sitting at home on a Saturday night?

2432
02:20:15,040 --> 02:20:16,160
Actually, maybe Friday night.

2433
02:20:16,520 --> 02:20:18,060
Playing video games and drinking beer?

2434
02:20:20,440 --> 02:20:21,640
It's gotta be close.

2435
02:20:22,240 --> 02:20:25,620
Like, very few things compares, I think.

2436
02:20:29,360 --> 02:20:31,300
Maybe watching a really good movie.

2437
02:20:32,380 --> 02:20:34,240
That one could maybe compare.

2438
02:20:34,820 --> 02:20:37,180
But it would have to be a sci-fi movie, you know?

2439
02:20:38,640 --> 02:20:41,560
There's a goddamn scarcity of sci-fi movies out there.

2440
02:20:41,700 --> 02:20:42,160
Good ones.

2441
02:20:42,380 --> 02:20:42,720
I mean.

2442
02:20:44,480 --> 02:20:46,180
They don't make them like they used to, man.

2443
02:20:50,650 --> 02:20:52,290
I want more sci-fi in my life.

2444
02:21:01,140 --> 02:21:01,500
Okay.

2445
02:21:01,680 --> 02:21:02,680
I think it's time to go to the others.

2446
02:21:02,840 --> 02:21:03,100
Hello!

2447
02:21:04,980 --> 02:21:06,640
Good thing I catch myself in the act.

2448
02:21:09,080 --> 02:21:11,560
You never wanna chop that tree to completion.

2449
02:21:14,680 --> 02:21:15,980
Never chop it to completion.

2450
02:21:16,980 --> 02:21:18,260
That's how the...

2451
02:21:18,880 --> 02:21:20,440
disaster in 2004 happened.

2452
02:21:34,710 --> 02:21:35,510
Thank you.

2453
02:21:36,990 --> 02:21:38,490
Alright, so it has become night.

2454
02:21:39,230 --> 02:21:41,390
We have to go back to the village and sleep.

2455
02:21:41,910 --> 02:21:43,310
And then I go to the bank.

2456
02:21:46,580 --> 02:21:49,040
Also, should I be planting these trees properly?

2457
02:21:52,280 --> 02:21:53,400
C and six, okay.

2458
02:21:54,520 --> 02:21:56,620
Let's just put them where I found them.

2459
02:21:58,600 --> 02:22:00,520
But I'm gonna go towards the village.

2460
02:22:00,740 --> 02:22:00,960
Hold on.

2461
02:22:01,020 --> 02:22:01,700
The village is that way.

2462
02:22:03,900 --> 02:22:04,540
Oh, wait.

2463
02:22:04,720 --> 02:22:07,460
I can no longer see where I got the trees because it's been covered.

2464
02:22:09,320 --> 02:22:10,240
They used to be dirt.

2465
02:22:10,340 --> 02:22:10,980
Now it's grass.

2466
02:22:11,680 --> 02:22:12,300
Just put them.

2467
02:22:13,280 --> 02:22:14,060
Put them randomly.

2468
02:22:14,880 --> 02:22:16,540
Especially the birch, because that's what we need.

2469
02:22:26,860 --> 02:22:27,780
Actually, I went too far.

2470
02:22:34,990 --> 02:22:35,350
Yeah.

2471
02:22:36,590 --> 02:22:38,050
So that always happens.

2472
02:22:42,420 --> 02:22:43,000
Wait.

2473
02:22:43,680 --> 02:22:45,520
Oh, it actually says raid omen now.

2474
02:22:46,420 --> 02:22:47,320
Ah, okay.

2475
02:22:47,980 --> 02:22:48,900
Okay, so...

2476
02:22:48,900 --> 02:22:49,760
I was right.

2477
02:22:50,920 --> 02:22:52,160
My theory is correct.

2478
02:22:56,010 --> 02:22:57,230
So what happens in five seconds?

2479
02:22:57,630 --> 02:22:58,530
Let's get ready.

2480
02:22:59,130 --> 02:22:59,850
Where's my food?

2481
02:23:00,010 --> 02:23:00,370
There we go.

2482
02:23:02,030 --> 02:23:03,470
Let's just get it over with.

2483
02:23:04,230 --> 02:23:05,330
Alright, buddies.

2484
02:23:06,010 --> 02:23:07,090
Get on with it.

2485
02:23:08,510 --> 02:23:09,970
I'm gonna stand next to this guy again.

2486
02:23:12,630 --> 02:23:13,390
Enemies are coming!

2487
02:23:14,130 --> 02:23:14,730
Wake up!

2488
02:23:20,950 --> 02:23:22,090
Dude, that reminds me.

2489
02:23:22,150 --> 02:23:23,510
I can find a horn like that.

2490
02:23:24,310 --> 02:23:26,050
Remember I found a horn once.

2491
02:23:27,410 --> 02:23:28,950
I need to find a horn like that.

2492
02:23:30,270 --> 02:23:30,890
Also, hold on.

2493
02:23:30,990 --> 02:23:32,490
My bow is not equipped.

2494
02:23:33,890 --> 02:23:35,330
I don't even have my bow on me.

2495
02:23:41,240 --> 02:23:43,280
I want them to hit each other here.

2496
02:23:48,940 --> 02:23:49,520
Oh my god.

2497
02:23:49,860 --> 02:23:50,940
They are nothing.

2498
02:23:52,280 --> 02:23:53,380
You're nothing, buddy!

2499
02:23:55,900 --> 02:23:57,680
Actually, I should use my axe here.

2500
02:23:58,680 --> 02:23:59,440
Jump in.

2501
02:23:59,700 --> 02:24:00,600
Hit them once.

2502
02:24:00,780 --> 02:24:01,160
Jump out.

2503
02:24:01,820 --> 02:24:02,220
Come back.

2504
02:24:03,820 --> 02:24:04,380
Next!

2505
02:24:07,430 --> 02:24:10,410
We should hang these banners in celebration of a nice victory.

2506
02:24:12,410 --> 02:24:13,550
One victory down.

2507
02:24:14,390 --> 02:24:14,810
Next!

2508
02:24:16,150 --> 02:24:17,310
Oh, you wanted some too?

