04:24:38,110 --> 04:24:39,990
I just need to be not disappointed.

5032
04:24:40,270 --> 04:24:40,770
That's all.

5033
04:24:43,900 --> 04:24:44,540
I'm scared.

5034
04:24:45,560 --> 04:24:46,480
I can't look!

5035
04:24:47,800 --> 04:24:48,760
Okay, wait, wait, wait.

5036
04:24:49,880 --> 04:24:50,680
Okay, I'm gonna look.

5037
04:24:50,860 --> 04:24:51,520
Was that an Enderman?

5038
04:24:53,100 --> 04:24:53,460
Enderman!

5039
04:24:54,940 --> 04:24:55,660
EDP time!

5040
04:24:57,960 --> 04:24:58,320
Buddy!

5041
04:24:58,760 --> 04:24:59,020
Come here!

5042
04:25:01,460 --> 04:25:02,020
That's right!

5043
04:25:02,940 --> 04:25:04,300
Here, let me make it easy for you.

5044
04:25:04,380 --> 04:25:05,940
Actually, let's not make it that easy.

5045
04:25:07,060 --> 04:25:08,100
Wait, can you even get up here?

5046
04:25:12,210 --> 04:25:12,570
Uh...

5047
04:25:16,990 --> 04:25:17,630
Are you alright?

5048
04:25:19,990 --> 04:25:21,930
Oh, you are actually stuck!

5049
04:25:23,470 --> 04:25:23,830
Aw...

5050
04:25:23,830 --> 04:25:24,810
Here, let me help you out.

5051
04:25:26,490 --> 04:25:27,430
You wanna fight me?

5052
04:25:28,470 --> 04:25:29,230
I got you.

5053
04:25:29,410 --> 04:25:29,810
Come on now.

5054
04:25:32,310 --> 04:25:32,670
Yeah.

5055
04:25:33,130 --> 04:25:35,030
Now move away so I can do one more here.

5056
04:25:35,170 --> 04:25:35,390
Come on.

5057
04:25:35,970 --> 04:25:36,470
Actually, hold on.

5058
04:25:36,550 --> 04:25:37,590
Why can't I just hit you from here?

5059
04:25:40,680 --> 04:25:41,040
Dude!

5060
04:25:43,160 --> 04:25:45,140
It's an ADP?!

5061
04:25:45,140 --> 04:25:46,040
Yes!

5062
04:25:52,790 --> 04:25:55,970
Ascension Enderman Defense Perimeter has been engaged!

5063
04:25:56,970 --> 04:25:58,690
Guys, I introduce...

5064
04:25:58,690 --> 04:26:00,270
EDP version 2.1.

5065
04:26:02,660 --> 04:26:03,190
There.

5066
04:26:05,840 --> 04:26:07,400
EDP 2.1.

5067
04:26:12,000 --> 04:26:12,680
There it is!

5068
04:26:13,720 --> 04:26:14,960
We gotta test that next time.

5069
04:26:15,420 --> 04:26:16,520
It can't be that easy.

5070
04:26:17,660 --> 04:26:18,860
It cannot be that easy.

5071
04:26:20,200 --> 04:26:22,240
Alright guys, I'm gonna look at my...

5072
04:26:22,860 --> 04:26:24,440
At my home in...

5073
04:26:24,440 --> 04:26:25,500
8 seconds.

5074
04:26:26,360 --> 04:26:26,940
From now.

5075
04:26:27,180 --> 04:26:29,300
8 seconds from now, I'll be looking at my home.

5076
04:26:32,540 --> 04:26:34,080
Okay, I'm gonna be looking at my home in...

5077
04:26:37,060 --> 04:26:39,000
8 seconds from now, I'll be looking at my home.

5078
04:26:43,810 --> 04:26:44,270
Okay.

5079
04:26:44,270 --> 04:26:46,610
I'm gonna look at my home in nine seconds.

5080
04:26:46,890 --> 04:26:47,030
No.

5081
04:26:47,410 --> 04:26:47,810
Here we go!

5082
04:26:50,230 --> 04:26:50,690
Hey!

5083
04:26:56,150 --> 04:26:57,370
It's not too bad.

5084
04:27:00,990 --> 04:27:03,230
That's actually not the worst thing in the world.

5085
04:27:06,180 --> 04:27:11,460
I mean, it's a little basic, but you know, with windows and some torches and some fucking lights and all that.

5086
04:27:11,600 --> 04:27:11,720
Oh!

5087
04:27:12,040 --> 04:27:13,420
This place is gonna be popping.

5088
04:27:16,720 --> 04:27:17,780
Not bad at all.

5089
04:27:18,400 --> 04:27:21,480
Maybe I don't like how far out the roof thing extends.

5090
04:27:22,280 --> 04:27:24,680
I'm a little unhappy about that, but maybe we can fix that.

5091
04:27:28,450 --> 04:27:29,370
We'll have to experiment.

5092
04:27:29,950 --> 04:27:31,330
But yeah, that doesn't look too bad.

5093
04:27:31,570 --> 04:27:33,590
And it's a nice visual marker as well.

5094
04:27:34,350 --> 04:27:34,890
You know?

5095
04:27:35,750 --> 04:27:37,870
Next time I'll be lost and go, where's my home?

5096
04:27:38,010 --> 04:27:39,470
I just... there it is!

5097
04:27:40,130 --> 04:27:40,910
It's right there!

5098
04:27:41,310 --> 04:27:43,290
You can see it, because it's up on a mountain.

5099
04:27:44,010 --> 04:27:44,950
Makes it easier to see.

5100
04:27:46,450 --> 04:27:47,130
Very nice.

5101
04:27:48,050 --> 04:27:48,530
In fact, hold on.

5102
04:27:48,570 --> 04:27:49,410
Am I even going home?

5103
04:27:49,610 --> 04:27:51,370
I mean, to my old home.

5104
04:27:52,270 --> 04:27:53,910
Am I going to the village right now?

5105
04:27:54,030 --> 04:27:54,250
You know what?

5106
04:27:54,430 --> 04:27:54,870
Let's...

5107
04:27:55,490 --> 04:27:57,510
Let's do a little bit of ascension magically.

5108
04:27:58,550 --> 04:27:58,990
Trickery.

5109
04:28:00,270 --> 04:28:02,370
I'm losing my ability to speak, it seems.

5110
04:28:07,750 --> 04:28:08,190
Huh?!

5111
04:28:08,190 --> 04:28:11,050
Dude, that's the exact design I had.

5112
04:28:11,170 --> 04:28:11,310
Look!

5113
04:28:11,510 --> 04:28:13,250
I remembered that perfectly.

5114
04:28:13,730 --> 04:28:15,570
Dude, that actually looks pretty fucking sick.

5115
04:28:15,570 --> 04:28:18,430
I love the way the dirt goes up like this around it.

5116
04:28:19,090 --> 04:28:21,510
I love that it's embedded in the mountain.

5117
04:28:23,430 --> 04:28:23,910
Huh?!

5118
04:28:23,910 --> 04:28:25,650
Pretty fucking cool.

5119
04:28:31,930 --> 04:28:33,190
And I think that's the village.

5120
04:28:40,730 --> 04:28:41,470
Alright, let's go.

5121
04:28:47,060 --> 04:28:49,660
I thought I had enough momentum to make it across that gap.

5122
04:28:50,300 --> 04:28:51,260
I was wrong.

5123
04:28:53,080 --> 04:28:56,740
Which is a weird experience for me because I've actually never been wrong.

5124
04:28:57,960 --> 04:29:00,800
Maybe you didn't know this about me, but I've actually never been wrong.

5125
04:29:02,480 --> 04:29:04,200
That may have been the first time.

5126
04:29:11,350 --> 04:29:14,070
Ah, I tried to do an MLG 360 gamer moment.

5127
04:29:14,330 --> 04:29:15,050
I couldn't do it.

5128
04:29:18,640 --> 04:29:19,080
B-butt.

5129
04:29:20,460 --> 04:29:21,280
I saw your butt.

5130
04:29:22,540 --> 04:29:23,600
I know what it looks like.

5131
04:29:24,500 --> 04:29:25,360
I've seen it all.

5132
04:29:26,500 --> 04:29:27,260
It's too late.

5133
04:29:27,460 --> 04:29:27,920
I've seen it.

5134
04:29:32,070 --> 04:29:32,670
Wait a minute.

5135
04:29:34,510 --> 04:29:37,470
That is my village because I remember that monstrosity over there.

5136
04:29:37,610 --> 04:29:40,210
In fact, I want to beeline it right over there.

5137
04:29:40,330 --> 04:29:40,590
Haha!

5138
04:29:41,670 --> 04:29:42,750
And chop it down.

5139
04:29:44,750 --> 04:29:46,390
In fact, I'm gonna do that right now.

5140
04:29:48,910 --> 04:29:50,050
It's beelining time!

5141
04:29:53,070 --> 04:29:54,850
Not to be confused with bee-buttlining.

5142
04:29:54,990 --> 04:29:55,650
That's another thing.

5143
04:29:55,870 --> 04:29:57,070
That's a whole science in itself.

5144
04:30:00,430 --> 04:30:01,390
I'm being silly.

5145
04:30:01,810 --> 04:30:02,570
I'm sorry.

5146
04:30:05,250 --> 04:30:06,430
I'm in a goofy mood.

5147
04:30:06,570 --> 04:30:08,130
Let's drink this bread here.

5148
04:30:10,710 --> 04:30:12,230
And let's go to town with a shovel.

5149
04:30:20,190 --> 04:30:21,410
Where the fuck is everyone?

5150
04:30:23,410 --> 04:30:24,330
Hey, I'm back!

5151
04:30:26,090 --> 04:30:27,030
Wake up, bitches!

5152
04:30:27,710 --> 04:30:28,470
Look at my home!

5153
04:30:28,630 --> 04:30:29,690
Oh, they can't see it from here.

5154
04:30:30,350 --> 04:30:30,750
Ooh.

5155
04:30:33,310 --> 04:30:33,590
Ah!

5156
04:30:34,430 --> 04:30:34,830
Aha!

5157
04:30:35,910 --> 04:30:36,650
Just the tip!

5158
04:30:39,110 --> 04:30:40,330
Isn't that lovely looking?

5159
04:30:40,970 --> 04:30:41,610
Look at that!

5160
04:30:42,270 --> 04:30:44,270
You can barely see there's something going on.

5161
04:30:44,350 --> 04:30:45,430
Something in the distance.

5162
04:30:45,570 --> 04:30:45,890
You don't...

5163
04:30:45,890 --> 04:30:48,150
You're not quite sure what it is when you approach, but you're excited.

5164
04:30:48,610 --> 04:30:49,090
You know?

5165
04:30:49,170 --> 04:30:50,110
Your blood gets pumping.

5166
04:30:50,210 --> 04:30:50,630
You're like, ooh!

5167
04:30:50,890 --> 04:30:51,650
What is this?

5168
04:30:51,750 --> 04:30:51,930
You know?

5169
04:30:51,990 --> 04:30:53,210
And you zoom in and you go, whoa!

5170
04:30:53,290 --> 04:30:54,110
It's a house!

5171
04:30:54,690 --> 04:30:55,470
And what's that?

5172
04:30:55,490 --> 04:30:58,590
You go closer, you notice it's someone else's house.

5173
04:30:58,590 --> 04:31:00,810
And not yours, and you become sad because it's not your house.

5174
04:31:05,200 --> 04:31:05,720
Wait!

5175
04:31:05,980 --> 04:31:07,720
I'm stealing that design for the chimney?

5176
04:31:10,790 --> 04:31:11,650
How'd they do that?

5177
04:31:15,140 --> 04:31:15,660
Cobblestone.

5178
04:31:16,400 --> 04:31:18,540
And I believe that is a fence.

5179
04:31:24,610 --> 04:31:25,130
Yep!

5180
04:31:27,770 --> 04:31:28,290
Stolen!

5181
04:31:29,330 --> 04:31:30,750
It's mine now, I made this.

5182
04:31:39,390 --> 04:31:39,850
Oh!

5183
04:31:39,950 --> 04:31:40,530
I didn't mean to hit you!

5184
04:31:40,670 --> 04:31:41,730
I meant to ride you.

5185
04:31:42,450 --> 04:31:43,870
I was trying to right click you.

5186
04:31:46,130 --> 04:31:47,170
Guess that didn't work.

5187
04:31:54,980 --> 04:31:55,440
Alright.

5188
04:31:55,900 --> 04:31:57,400
Clean up operation 31.

5189
04:32:02,330 --> 04:32:03,170
Let's go to town.

5190
04:32:04,710 --> 04:32:05,890
This city needs us.

5191
04:32:12,690 --> 04:32:14,310
Where the fuck is everyone actually?

5192
04:32:14,550 --> 04:32:15,510
Did they all die?

5193
04:32:21,820 --> 04:32:22,720
There's nobody here.

5194
04:32:28,860 --> 04:32:29,320
Assholes!

5195
04:32:29,320 --> 04:32:37,300
Why didn't they stay inside and let the guy who came to kill the raiders finish the job by himself?

5196
04:32:39,160 --> 04:32:39,920
That's dumb.

5197
04:32:43,330 --> 04:32:44,750
I wonder if they respawn.

5198
04:32:45,990 --> 04:32:47,690
And if so, how long that takes?

5199
04:32:50,050 --> 04:32:50,610
Oops!

5200
04:32:51,110 --> 04:32:51,990
There goes my shovel.

5201
04:32:52,530 --> 04:32:55,010
I'm just gonna punch the dirt out of existence.

5202
04:32:56,630 --> 04:32:59,210
You ever just get so mad you punch dirt out of existence?

5203
04:33:01,710 --> 04:33:02,310
I do.

5204
04:33:10,250 --> 04:33:11,210
Looking much better.

5205
04:33:12,990 --> 04:33:14,130
That pleased me greatly.

5206
04:33:15,990 --> 04:33:19,230
Now we're gonna take everything from the chest, and we're gonna raid this place, of course.

5207
04:33:21,290 --> 04:33:24,170
I actually really like the way they did their...

5208
04:33:24,950 --> 04:33:25,670
little...

5209
04:33:26,690 --> 04:33:27,410
flower...

5210
04:33:27,410 --> 04:33:28,810
pot thingies here.

5211
04:33:30,050 --> 04:33:30,890
I'm stealing that.

5212
04:33:32,790 --> 04:33:33,510
Stolen.

5213
04:33:33,930 --> 04:33:34,830
I made this.

5214
04:33:35,730 --> 04:33:36,610
It's mine.

5215
04:33:37,010 --> 04:33:38,310
I'm gonna copy that.

5216
04:33:39,010 --> 04:33:40,370
What else should I copy?

5217
04:33:43,170 --> 04:33:43,610
Uh...

5218
04:33:46,800 --> 04:33:47,940
What was that sound?

5219
04:33:49,640 --> 04:33:50,080
Oh!

5220
04:33:51,760 --> 04:33:53,380
Long time no fucking see!

5221
04:33:53,500 --> 04:33:55,380
I guess these things don't exist in Hardcore or something.

5222
04:33:56,200 --> 04:33:59,920
The last time I encountered these was before I played Hardcore.

5223
04:34:09,880 --> 04:34:11,300
Also, my shield is about to break.

5224
04:34:12,920 --> 04:34:13,360
Ah!

5225
04:34:13,600 --> 04:34:14,040
Bastard.

5226
04:34:21,390 --> 04:34:22,490
Also, there's only one of them.

5227
04:34:24,530 --> 04:34:25,630
There goes my sword!

5228
04:34:26,970 --> 04:34:28,130
Everything is breaking here.

5229
04:34:29,170 --> 04:34:29,410
Uh-oh.

5230
04:34:29,930 --> 04:34:31,010
Oh, there's enemies everywhere.

5231
04:34:32,270 --> 04:34:33,110
This is bad.

5232
04:34:34,110 --> 04:34:35,170
Nah, I don't like that.

5233
04:34:37,930 --> 04:34:38,390
Fuck.

5234
04:34:38,550 --> 04:34:38,930
Off.

5235
04:34:39,110 --> 04:34:39,470
Oh, god.

5236
04:34:40,890 --> 04:34:41,350
Bro!

5237
04:34:41,790 --> 04:34:42,250
Okay.

5238
04:34:43,870 --> 04:34:45,290
Alright, they all want a piece of me.

5239
04:34:47,650 --> 04:34:49,950
Wait, did I actually chase that guy away?

5240
04:34:51,610 --> 04:34:52,070
Huh.

5241
04:34:53,150 --> 04:34:53,550
Nice.

5242
04:34:54,390 --> 04:34:55,390
What do I need?

5243
04:34:55,590 --> 04:34:56,070
All of it.

5244
04:34:56,470 --> 04:34:57,490
That's the answer, of course.

5245
04:35:03,380 --> 04:35:05,500
This is what happens when you go down from your fortress.

5246
04:35:07,340 --> 04:35:08,800
That's why you want to stay up high.

5247
04:35:09,000 --> 04:35:10,480
Away from all this...

5248
04:35:10,480 --> 04:35:10,600
Oh.

5249
04:35:11,960 --> 04:35:13,060
Excuse me, guy.

5250
04:35:14,440 --> 04:35:15,340
You wanna try this?

5251
04:35:16,780 --> 04:35:18,260
I don't have a sh-weapon!

5252
04:35:18,620 --> 04:35:19,220
Don't hit me.

5253
04:35:22,140 --> 04:35:23,340
Where's time?!

5254
04:35:25,200 --> 04:35:25,800
No!

5255
04:35:26,780 --> 04:35:28,480
I'm fucking dead, I'm fucking dead, I'm fucking dead!

5256
04:35:29,640 --> 04:35:31,880
Are you kidding me?!

5257
04:35:34,810 --> 04:35:35,830
Brother!

5258
04:35:36,150 --> 04:35:37,670
What is the timing on that?!

5259
04:35:39,170 --> 04:35:41,890
What is the timing on that?!

5260
04:35:41,890 --> 04:35:43,330
For fuck's sake!

5261
04:35:45,470 --> 04:35:46,470
Oh, I'm here!

5262
04:35:47,230 --> 04:35:48,310
Yeah, dude!

5263
04:35:48,970 --> 04:35:49,110
Ha!

5264
04:35:49,690 --> 04:35:50,650
Not even a problem!

5265
04:35:53,800 --> 04:35:56,700
I thought I would be spawning back at the very beginning, but of course no.

5266
04:35:56,860 --> 04:35:57,480
There's a bed!

5267
04:35:57,980 --> 04:35:58,960
And I slept in it.

5268
04:35:59,260 --> 04:36:00,940
Speaking of that, let's go to sleep.

5269
04:36:01,600 --> 04:36:02,440
And you know what else?

5270
04:36:02,560 --> 04:36:03,340
Let's steal the bed.

5271
04:36:04,600 --> 04:36:05,520
Wait, where did I come from?

5272
04:36:11,190 --> 04:36:12,130
Did I come from over here?

5273
04:36:14,390 --> 04:36:14,750
Sleep!

5274
04:36:25,500 --> 04:36:26,660
Alright, alright, alright, alright.

5275
04:36:31,230 --> 04:36:32,530
I'm gonna kill that Enderman now.

5276
04:36:40,450 --> 04:36:45,570
I guess the rule is, when those flying bastards appear, you don't stop until they're actually killed.

5277
04:36:46,250 --> 04:36:48,990
If they have disappeared, it's not safe, they will come back.

5278
04:36:50,870 --> 04:36:52,210
New rule has been learned.

5279
04:36:52,810 --> 04:36:52,970
Ha!

5280
04:36:53,270 --> 04:36:55,010
I'm gonna hit people in the head with a bone.

5281
04:36:58,030 --> 04:36:59,210
Give me all of this.

5282
04:37:02,920 --> 04:37:03,680
Oh yeah.

5283
04:37:05,620 --> 04:37:06,520
Equip the armor.

5284
04:37:09,120 --> 04:37:10,240
My shield is gone.

5285
04:37:10,880 --> 04:37:12,160
Can I make one real quick?

5286
04:37:12,420 --> 04:37:13,060
I cannot.

5287
04:37:14,740 --> 04:37:15,620
Where's my metal?

5288
04:37:16,720 --> 04:37:18,040
Oh, I didn't pick everything up.

5289
04:37:18,220 --> 04:37:18,460
Shit.

5290
04:37:26,080 --> 04:37:26,480
Ah!

5291
04:37:27,300 --> 04:37:28,560
Okay, inventory is full, I guess.

5292
04:37:28,680 --> 04:37:28,880
Fuck.

5293
04:37:29,260 --> 04:37:29,740
Throw that away.

5294
04:37:32,510 --> 04:37:33,930
Did I just destroy something?

5295
04:37:34,410 --> 04:37:35,450
That I shouldn't have?

5296
04:37:39,400 --> 04:37:40,220
What's the problem?

5297
04:37:43,560 --> 04:37:45,260
Wait, did I not have more metal on me?

5298
04:37:48,200 --> 04:37:48,560
Iron.

5299
04:37:48,960 --> 04:37:49,400
I mean.

5300
04:37:56,460 --> 04:37:57,520
Where did the Enderman go?

5301
04:38:01,620 --> 04:38:02,480
I hate my inventory.

5302
04:38:03,180 --> 04:38:04,440
Throw away the wool, we don't need any more.

5303
04:38:05,560 --> 04:38:08,760
Throw away the cobblestone, fuck that bullshit, and the egg can go away.

5304
04:38:08,960 --> 04:38:09,340
All of that.

5305
04:38:10,600 --> 04:38:12,100
