5590
04:52:38,640 --> 04:52:39,000
Hey!

5591
04:52:39,380 --> 04:52:39,680
Isanti!

5592
04:52:39,860 --> 04:52:40,600
Yeah, I gave you a sub.

5593
04:52:40,760 --> 04:52:41,400
