5602
04:52:53,720 --> 04:52:54,560
Thank you guys so much.

5603
04:52:55,620 --> 04:52:58,380
By the way, earlier Jen gifted 25 community subs.

5604
04:52:58,500 --> 04:52:59,180
That was incredible.

5605
04:53:00,060 --> 04:53:02,420
So maybe in his name I have to put the sapling on top.

5606
04:53:04,380 --> 04:53:05,480
Just to try it once.

5607
04:53:05,640 --> 04:53:06,440
To see how it is.

5608
04:53:07,620 --> 04:53:08,940
I'll do it in your name, Jen.

5609
04:53:12,900 --> 04:53:13,600
What do you mean, clips?

5610
04:53:13,920 --> 04:53:14,920
There's nothing to see here.

5611
04:53:15,520 --> 04:53:16,180
I know, right?

5612
04:53:21,500 --> 04:53:24,160
Oliver, can you weigh in on whether the roof is the roof or the floor?

5613
04:53:25,000 --> 04:53:25,980
No, no, the...

5614
04:53:25,980 --> 04:53:27,960
The floor is the roof.

5615
04:53:29,000 --> 04:53:30,820
But only from below the roof.

5616
04:53:31,520 --> 04:53:34,900
The roof is the roof, but when you go below the roof, then the floor is the roof.

5617
04:53:35,960 --> 04:53:37,160
Uh, uh, whoa, whoa!

5618
04:53:37,920 --> 04:53:39,100
I messed up the English!

5619
04:53:39,740 --> 04:53:40,620
It's a ceiling!

5620
04:53:41,020 --> 04:53:42,560
That's the word I was looking for!

5621
04:53:42,560 --> 04:53:43,480
The floor ceiling!

5622
04:53:46,100 --> 04:53:46,560
Exactly!

5623
04:53:48,120 --> 04:53:49,660
Oh, that's the perfect word!

5624
04:53:57,050 --> 04:54:00,570
Finished your OG Minecraft series plus wrap-up streams just last week.

5625
04:54:00,850 --> 04:54:02,790
It was one of the best blind playthroughs I've seen.

5626
04:54:02,870 --> 04:54:03,650
Lots of epic moments.

5627
04:54:03,810 --> 04:54:04,950
Yeah, that was so much fun.

5628
04:54:05,250 --> 04:54:06,490
I'm glad you enjoyed it too.

5629
04:54:09,090 --> 04:54:12,990
Like I said back then, I still can't believe that Minecraft has become such a big deal now.

5630
04:54:14,470 --> 04:54:17,590
I was not expecting to enjoy that game when I started.

5631
04:54:17,750 --> 04:54:18,990
I mean, maybe a little bit, you know?

5632
04:54:20,510 --> 04:54:22,450
Definitely did not expect to try it again.

5633
04:54:23,970 --> 04:54:24,850
And here we are!

5634
04:54:31,360 --> 04:54:34,320
The OG series felt like a really high-quality movie.

5635
04:54:34,500 --> 04:54:34,920
Really!

5636
04:54:35,380 --> 04:54:36,900
But also a really long one.

5637
04:54:37,660 --> 04:54:39,880
I don't even know how many hours I had at that point.

5638
04:54:39,980 --> 04:54:40,420
Maybe a hundred.

5639
04:54:40,800 --> 04:54:42,400
Maybe almost two hundred, actually.

5640
04:54:43,160 --> 04:54:43,800
Wait, is that true?

5641
04:54:44,100 --> 04:54:44,840
150 maybe?

5642
04:54:45,000 --> 04:54:45,640
I don't remember.

5643
04:54:50,660 --> 04:54:52,960
Why does O turn into that hamster on screen?

5644
04:54:53,120 --> 04:54:54,240
I... that's a good question.

5645
04:54:54,360 --> 04:54:56,240
I don't understand it myself, but I like it.

5646
04:54:56,360 --> 04:54:57,180
So we never changed it.

5647
04:55:03,820 --> 04:55:05,860
I've been playing for a little over 12 years.

5648
04:55:06,000 --> 04:55:07,800
This game never leaves your life once you start.

5649
04:55:07,920 --> 04:55:08,880
You only take breaks.

5650
04:55:09,120 --> 04:55:10,340
Just like StarCraft!

5651
04:55:10,580 --> 04:55:11,700
At least in my case.

5652
04:55:13,480 --> 04:55:15,160
Will you build Jimmy a cozy spot?

5653
04:55:15,640 --> 04:55:16,320
Of course!

5654
04:55:16,500 --> 04:55:19,500
He's gonna join all the other farm animals and have friends down in...

5655
04:55:19,960 --> 04:55:21,100
at the foot of the mountain.

5656
04:55:21,620 --> 04:55:27,360
Or maybe he will have an honorary pig pen at the very top to look over all of his pig peasants.

5657
04:55:30,180 --> 04:55:34,260
Maybe we have to have a pig lord for every single animal type.

5658
04:55:35,300 --> 04:55:36,760
Or animal lord, you know?

5659
04:55:36,840 --> 04:55:40,940
So we have a pig lord, dog lord, and they all have their little houses.

5660
04:55:42,580 --> 04:55:43,480
Dude, I'm gonna...

5661
04:55:43,480 --> 04:55:47,580
I'm gonna have a dog and I'm gonna build a little dog house on top of a tiny mountain somewhere.

5662
04:55:48,120 --> 04:55:49,900
So that dog can have his own kingdom.

5663
04:55:53,540 --> 04:55:54,720
He's gonna eat him, isn't he?

5664
04:55:55,040 --> 04:55:55,480
Noooo!

5665
04:55:56,080 --> 04:55:57,320
I wouldn't do that.

5666
04:55:59,080 --> 04:55:59,740
But yes.

5667
04:56:03,950 --> 04:56:05,550
When do you think you'll most like the next stream?

5668
04:56:05,770 --> 04:56:07,550
Next stream I'm gonna play Slay the Spire though.

5669
04:56:09,290 --> 04:56:10,170
And probably...

5670
04:56:10,850 --> 04:56:11,930
the day after tomorrow.

5671
04:56:12,730 --> 04:56:14,810
And then after that we're gonna continue with this series.

5672
04:56:16,330 --> 04:56:18,030
I'm addicted to Slay the Spire still.

5673
04:56:18,850 --> 04:56:20,490
I gotta Slay that Spire, guys.

5674
04:56:22,190 --> 04:56:23,270
So many good games.

5675
04:56:24,710 --> 04:56:25,590
And a fish pool.

5676
04:56:25,710 --> 04:56:25,970
Yes!

5677
04:56:26,090 --> 04:56:27,770
We gotta put the axolotl in there.

5678
04:56:31,580 --> 04:56:33,820
Have you fixed Slay the Spire relics for next time?

5679
04:56:33,880 --> 04:56:34,380
I have!

5680
04:56:35,220 --> 04:56:36,200
At least I think so.

5681
04:56:36,280 --> 04:56:37,940
I also installed the map markers mod.

5682
04:56:38,980 --> 04:56:41,760
Maybe I should just do a dry run real quick just to see if it works.

5683
04:56:41,760 --> 04:56:43,180
Obviously I can't do that with Twitch.

5684
04:56:43,500 --> 04:56:44,360
With the integration.

5685
04:56:44,620 --> 04:56:47,980
But if the other mods work, then I assume that mod should work as well.

5686
04:56:52,400 --> 04:56:54,120
But will you Spire the Slay?

5687
04:56:54,380 --> 04:56:55,480
That's a good question.

5688
04:56:56,640 --> 04:56:57,880
I'll have to think on that.

5689
04:57:01,980 --> 04:57:05,580
Eye level oven and foot level crafting table.

5690
04:57:10,680 --> 04:57:11,200
Yes!

5691
04:57:12,080 --> 04:57:12,600
Yes!

5692
04:57:13,140 --> 04:57:14,080
I love it!

5693
04:57:14,780 --> 04:57:15,960
More like knee level.

5694
04:57:16,300 --> 04:57:16,940
But yes.

5695
04:57:18,340 --> 04:57:20,380
Should we avoid spoilers in the YouTube comments?

5696
04:57:20,540 --> 04:57:21,060
I mean...

5697
04:57:21,060 --> 04:57:24,020
You can talk about the game, sure, and what's happening in the episode.

5698
04:57:24,840 --> 04:57:27,200
All I ask is that you don't tell me what to do, you know?

5699
04:57:27,800 --> 04:57:29,420
Or what I'm doing wrong, or whatever.

5700
04:57:29,560 --> 04:57:31,240
Just don't give me any...

5701
04:57:32,020 --> 04:57:33,320
Don't guide my hand, basically.

5702
04:57:33,820 --> 04:57:34,320
That's all.

5703
04:57:34,580 --> 04:57:37,040
But you're free to talk about whatever happened in the episode, of course.

5704
04:57:39,180 --> 04:57:44,500
And by the way, even if it's a spoiler, you can always just spoiler market, you know, in the comments.

5705
04:57:44,780 --> 04:57:45,180
Or...

5706
04:57:45,180 --> 04:57:47,720
If you don't manage to do that, I will still...

5707
04:57:47,720 --> 04:57:50,400
I can still usually tell if it's a spoiler or not, so I just stop reading it.

5708
04:57:51,080 --> 04:57:53,340
It's honestly quite easy to spot.

5709
04:57:53,660 --> 04:57:56,800
Like, I can tell within a split second if something is a spoiler or not.

5710
04:57:57,720 --> 04:57:59,320
I've become quite good with that.

5711
