5736
04:59:17,980 --> 04:59:20,440
I'm a ride-or-die spruce connoisseur myself.

5737
04:59:20,740 --> 04:59:21,060
Oh, yeah?

5738
04:59:22,280 --> 04:59:23,760
I really like the oak.

5739
04:59:24,540 --> 04:59:26,280
But spruce is also kinda nice.

