04:59:28,880 --> 04:59:31,680
The thing is, I haven't really tried that many different variations.

5741
04:59:32,040 --> 04:59:33,040
At least to build with them.

5742
04:59:35,950 --> 04:59:37,430
But I really like the oak.

5743
04:59:37,610 --> 04:59:39,710
Maybe just from what the trees look like.

5744
04:59:39,910 --> 04:59:41,330
It's... I don't know.

5745
04:59:41,510 --> 04:59:41,930
It's nice.

5746
04:59:42,630 --> 04:59:44,010
But I also like...

5747
04:59:45,150 --> 04:59:45,510
Spruce.

5748
04:59:47,810 --> 04:59:49,050
Do you know about the new update?

5749
04:59:49,370 --> 04:59:50,870
Do you mean the one that's coming?

5750
04:59:50,890 --> 04:59:52,390
Or the one that's already in the game?

5751
04:59:53,150 --> 04:59:54,830
Because I don't know anything, really.

5752
04:59:55,610 --> 04:59:57,110
